###############################################################

### Invalid Time In

POST {{apiUrl}}/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "internship_id": "{{internshipId}}",
  "attendance_date": "2026-08-12",
  "time_in": "25:00",
  "time_out": "17:00"
}

###

### Expected:
### HTTP 400
### Validation error


###############################################################

### Invalid Time Out

POST {{apiUrl}}/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "internship_id": "{{internshipId}}",
  "attendance_date": "2026-08-12",
  "time_in": "08:00",
  "time_out": "25:00"
}

###

### Expected:
### HTTP 400
### Validation error


###############################################################

### Time Out Before Time In

POST {{apiUrl}}/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "internship_id": "{{internshipId}}",
  "attendance_date": "2026-08-12",
  "time_in": "17:00",
  "time_out": "08:00"
}

###

### Expected:
### HTTP 400
###
### Time-out must be later than time-in.


###############################################################

### Attendance Duration Too Short

POST {{apiUrl}}/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "internship_id": "{{internshipId}}",
  "attendance_date": "2026-08-12",
  "time_in": "08:00",
  "time_out": "09:00"
}

###

### Expected:
### HTTP 400
###
### Attendance duration is too short for the standard one-hour break.


