Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "internship_id": "{{internshipId}}",
  "attendance_date": "2026-08-12",
  "time_in": "08:00",
  "time_out": "17:00"
}

###

### Expected:
### HTTP 403
###
### Insufficient permissions.


